{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghv238RyUHJknPuqNHwJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That notification is a leftover idle-wait tick from an earlier monitor, not a new request. Nothing is waiting on it, and no further work is pending from this message.\n\nThe state from my last reply still holds. The bundled HTML and `exit-interview.json` are in the work folder root. The AI Hub shared-world play and the Lightning Round are built, and the four hub harness scenarios pass. Several TASK features are still partial: the endings and Green Room presentation, some animations, and the audio, which I haven't listened to. So the completion criterion is not yet met.\n\nIf you want me to continue, the most useful next steps are the endings and Green Room staging, and the missing mime and brute animations. Tell me which to take first, or if you'd rather I stop here and leave the deliverable as it is."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2724,"cache_read_input_tokens":705507,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2724},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eec69157-3f75-40b4-be93-e6ea9b3a321a","uuid":"ba221ab5-149f-4e0f-8df3-e0ae66cf8e11","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:48:56.714Z","request_id":"req_011Cghv22m78RH71qSnmrGbY"}
