{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cghvqoi8YN2oxgXWuf3N7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The completion criterion is not met, and I've stopped retrying, because the remaining items need things I can't do here. Here is where it stands.\n\n**Blocked, not just unfinished**\n- **Audio:** I cannot listen to the music, voices or effects, so their quality is unverified.\n- **GPU lighting per set:** the engine's GPU path needs WebGPU, which I can't test. I implemented the canvas-lighting version instead.\n\n**Unfinished**\n- **Ending beats:** timed to each song's tempo, not synced to real playback.\n- **Green Room:** simpler than the plan's full room.\n\nMaking the Green Room match the plan is doable with more work. The other items need a listening test or a WebGPU-capable browser, so I can't close them from here.\n\nThe deliverables are in the work folder root: `MashTV-SmashTV-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-050305.html` and `exit-interview.json`, which parses. The test suite passes, 119 of 119.\n\n**Source Information:** Smash TV (1990), twin-stick arena shooter, 1–4 players, engine my-3D2dge v0.85.2 with patches P1, P3, P4; AI Hub shared-world, 1–4 players; model claude-haiku-5-5 (medium effort); usage unknown.\n\n**Testing Feedback:** Headless suites, the AI Hub harness (passed for 2 players, 4 players with latency and loss, host leave, and server copy), and real-browser checks. The bot playthrough and the hub harness caught the most real bugs.\n\n**Engine Feedback:** The arcade module and input presets were useful. I patched the input hook and the arcade's per-player input (P1, P3), listed in `engine/PATCHES.md`. Overlay units are buffer pixels, which took trial to learn.\n\n**Prompt Feedback:** The room data and the exit-interview shape were clear. Scope was hard to judge: which parts were required for a first delivery and which were stretch goals. Splitting the plan into milestones would help."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1808,"cache_read_input_tokens":758734,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1808},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eec69157-3f75-40b4-be93-e6ea9b3a321a","uuid":"6639ab8d-2f02-4c91-a952-e09ef13df511","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:59:47.513Z","request_id":"req_011CghvqoGbEXXe1tAjREK51"}
